    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add to wishlist, and start your soul control journey</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/2dda9d48e89e79adbe64571f29ec0fca.avif?t=1754150645\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In \u300aSoul \u2022 Apocalypto\u300b, you will play as Jin Ge. Facing various challenges, you are never alone in the fight. You need to rescue and subdue different creatures on this planet and recruit them. Each creature possesses multiple skills. Choosing the target creature and configuring the skills of your companions are the keys to overcoming every difficulty. The trial version includes the teaching of game operation methods and the content of the first chapter of the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use the Soul Forge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat alien monsters, extract their souls, and control their bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/23d380e1d2d47acb064ba2c217b1a66f.poster.avif?t=1754150645\" width=480 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/23d380e1d2d47acb064ba2c217b1a66f.webm?t=1754150645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/23d380e1d2d47acb064ba2c217b1a66f.mp4?t=1754150645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skills of these creatures can be activated and changed at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/90e854efc799e80ad48eba59bee4e3c5.poster.avif?t=1754150645\" width=480 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/90e854efc799e80ad48eba59bee4e3c5.webm?t=1754150645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/90e854efc799e80ad48eba59bee4e3c5.mp4?t=1754150645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The front and back rows are the eternal truth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different creatures are suitable for different positions. Combine the front and back rows of monsters to form a combat advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/0beab8716b77f202361553702800840c.poster.avif?t=1754150645\" width=480 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/0beab8716b77f202361553702800840c.webm?t=1754150645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/0beab8716b77f202361553702800840c.mp4?t=1754150645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge the Boss of this area</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is our final test</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/e88c7dd1fc29fae386d5ad382bad88d1.poster.avif?t=1754150645\" width=480 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/e88c7dd1fc29fae386d5ad382bad88d1.webm?t=1754150645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/e88c7dd1fc29fae386d5ad382bad88d1.mp4?t=1754150645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Apocalypto is an RPG that also emphasizes strategic team selection. You can summon various characters to form your own team, and by strategically assigning skills to each companion, you can shape your team's unique traits. Choosing the right companions and configuring their skills effectively is the key to overcoming all challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/e27cf6ac21b6245c1aa1ff730d7b05ea.poster.avif?t=1754150645\" width=480 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/e27cf6ac21b6245c1aa1ff730d7b05ea.webm?t=1754150645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/e27cf6ac21b6245c1aa1ff730d7b05ea.mp4?t=1754150645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/83410a0fee00423f866db323b71b432b.poster.avif?t=1754150645\" width=480 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/83410a0fee00423f866db323b71b432b.webm?t=1754150645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/83410a0fee00423f866db323b71b432b.mp4?t=1754150645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Apocalypto is an RPG that also emphasizes strategic team selection. You can summon various characters to form your own team, and by strategically assigning skills to each companion, you can shape your team's unique traits. Choosing the right companions and configuring their skills effectively is the key to overcoming all challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/e27cf6ac21b6245c1aa1ff730d7b05ea.poster.avif?t=1754150645\" width=480 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/e27cf6ac21b6245c1aa1ff730d7b05ea.webm?t=1754150645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/e27cf6ac21b6245c1aa1ff730d7b05ea.mp4?t=1754150645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/83410a0fee00423f866db323b71b432b.poster.avif?t=1754150645\" width=480 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/83410a0fee00423f866db323b71b432b.webm?t=1754150645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365360/extras/83410a0fee00423f866db323b71b432b.mp4?t=1754150645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "\u300aSoul Apocalypto\u300b is a role-playing game that also emphasizes the selection of team strategies. You can summon different roles to form your own team, and realize team characteristics by deploying role skills. To defeat different enemies and pass bosses in this way!",
